{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/blvh6j34jaxliqje1nfoj3r6kaud51m.mp3","text":"烧了吧，反正这些纸你也不会看第二眼。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/88/a9ktvh6d3ks261oino1nkg4o08lnstq.mp3","text":"要我在房间里布防，地板就一定会坏。我是不太介意，你自己考虑清楚。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/3v56etb6xlu0iuol6i6kfktrda649i8.mp3","text":"这里还有皇家近卫学校的人？哼——有点意思。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/38/krkq5u537aw1k0bae8z41hnxbcccw3t.mp3","text":"校准一下瞄具，不，还是先做箭矢，上次订的材料应该快到了......别烦我，一边去。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/44/qaumdbqi86psk7neycejkv0jmv86g1t.mp3","text":"离开瓦伊凡的人大多不认同在萨尔贡的佣兵生活，到了维多利亚，总会做些其他事情。比如说......啊，是了，从工，从农。拥有自己的土地。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/6xddcu6ns6ydv7k5k17vcnjfzsneh0u.mp3","text":"我以前不是做炮手的，你应该看得出来。侦察、潜入、近距格斗，主要是学这些。因为不喜欢，教官又不允许我调任，干脆就退学了。学自己讨厌的知识有什么意思？","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/cyuwwm85943e4r42c3meu34jaqg9q48.mp3","text":"你真是没救了，我怎么可能穿着这身进工坊？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/6mzz20jqac49fpqi5lbwus8xdcaycj2.mp3","text":"这把武器可是用来攻击移动城市的，拿来让你们对付散兵真是大材小用。什么时候让我打几座城市练练手？","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/01/9qx10lnwu9nl954svx4cd3yvoatbc6e.mp3","text":"不觉得肩膀这一片的结晶体颜色和发色很称么，正好我也喜欢穿半露肩的衣服。可惜啊，感染痕迹如果能和那个叙拉古小信使一样是整片的就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/ojbnuxx1wmoa1jyczjvpi4ov6u0o10d.mp3","text":"我先回去整理材料了，没必要陪着这家伙浪费时间。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/t71fhsl8wtofrmn4k9lxp50uwsjoi70.mp3","text":"阿丽安罗特，代号熔泉。我不喜欢给普通人干活，希望你能表现出自己有别于常人的地方。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/f76n7vifwfk86hltp7593wu2rg6oznu.mp3","text":"没什么意思，走了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/ig20e3kab4oswi8nqgz41f8ysx0eupc.mp3","text":"后勤部的人在想什么，怎么把我随手做的......啧，行，我收下，算你心意到了。再见。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/dm76hf37w1yvp3lbn92bmngficyo2ip.mp3","text":"想必你见识过德拉克的烈火，有想过将它撒在敌人头上的那一刻吗？我，能给你实现。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/m9uxo3wm7ix8s9agrpii15v7bdu132t.mp3","text":"我听着。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/fk17cqwsvsjkdf19axajhvvdkwo4on2.mp3","text":"开工了，认真点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/du0dltoctjxr8gh1wiinij3x1pmsbp6.mp3","text":"你们先走，我准备点东西。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/hs0mue6r0stk9ebkf7aqhi5469axvaj.mp3","text":"视野开阔，等待命令。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/05eb82x2ufkga3j5wnrrg4rqfj08sb8.mp3","text":"还没好么？","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/ad81bo6k7m7jbh04ew7hiq8vql4z14i.mp3","text":"哦？","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/innhvaxzok9kr8wocnqrzbugf7fmlyj.mp3","text":"固定完毕。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/ki41v8b9m3jgu9gvjhds39wljnfqxrv.mp3","text":"就位。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:4/42/73l1c703rzji5f7k83j45t2umz2oq0g.mp3","text":"没必要用眼睛看，把地图给我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/rtbkolu9nf5tvbbpq8ee5tgfc7vtecg.mp3","text":"这块清空了，下一处。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/tqi7nm6q879ulaowaydyd58gcyn2ns2.mp3","text":"箭矢撒下去什么都不会剩。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/38/jmsjk2o8brpwwuqgmbetce7ml2qt9ai.mp3","text":"哈，在烧尽之前，火怎么会熄灭？","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/pv8prc7zuuuiir7cqfib38swjw4k3yj.mp3","text":"能完全发挥这家伙性能的人可不多，你算一个。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/0ubfv5zx649afizlxxf8o6yxu62fyy9.mp3","text":"没沾上太多灰，很好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_363_toddi/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/mesuiee9exy0frjj9s70gxx4s6xh4s0.mp3","text":"弹药比这几个人要贵重，你自己解决。","alt":"voi